cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "ctr-calibration: Calibration Decay under Temporal Drift in CTR Prediction"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Jin"
    given-names: "DongHyeon"
    email: "asmjjya@gmail.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/JinVibe/ctr-calibration"
abstract: >-
  Empirical study of calibration decay in CTR prediction models under real
  temporal drift: how ECE degrades with temporal distance from the training
  window, and how much of that degradation post-hoc calibration methods
  (temperature scaling, isotonic regression) recover.
keywords:
  - calibration
  - CTR prediction
  - temporal drift
  - expected calibration error
  - computational advertising
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-08-21"
